[A.]
<h2>Final Showdown?</h2> 
<i>"Surrender is never an option."<br>
--General Heinder's last words</i>
<p>A you approach Lord Gunton's Island, you arm your island with your technology, but something doesn't seem right.
Then it all hits you that there is an extreme lack of geysers.  You can't go back now, but you might not get to go forward either.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
